Good plan if you like to carry an arsenal to switch among.  As
you go deeper it becomes usefull to carry an assortment of other
items and to use a compromise weapon.  For a Valk I like Greyswandir
or Frost Brand dual weaponed with a highly enchanted silver saber
for general combat deep down, plus a dozen blessed +6 fireproof
elven daggers.  I keep any other artifact in a chest in my cache
or get a pet to wield it.  This not because it's a finely tuned
solution to an individual situation but because it is an average
that works fine in any situation.

