Monsters use any artifact over any other weapon, but without an
artifact they use a specific list of types in order of the damage
they'd do.  If your Archon had an artifact weapon you should know,
but the ToM (tusungri), SB (runesword), Cleaver (battleaxe) and
Snickersnee (katana) are all weapon types that beat long swords
so it could have one of those, or any other long sword artifact.

More likely its current weapon is cursed and welded on and it
*can't* switch to an artifact.  Until I read the next sentence ...

